 the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Unlock structured data from any source.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F97316, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #06B6D4, background #0F0F0F, surface #1A1A1A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus Data Extraction</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0f0f0f] text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans overflow-hidden selection:bg-white/20\">\n\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-8 py-6 z-20 relative\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:programming-linear\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-wide uppercase\">Nexus</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-10 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-400 tracking-wide uppercase\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Sandbox</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Rates</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">About</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">API</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Support</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <!-- Skill: Border Gradient -->\n            <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-sm bg-gradient-to-r from-neutral-700 via-neutral-400 to-neutral-700 hidden sm:block\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"block px-5 py-2.5 bg-[#0f0f0f] text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide hover:bg-neutral-900 transition-colors rounded-[1px]\">\n                    Start Free Trial\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-5 py-2.5 bg-white text-black text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide rounded-sm hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors\">\n                Login\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Area -->\n    <main class=\"flex-grow relative flex flex-col justify-end pb-24 z-10\">\n\n        <!-- Animation Canvas Container -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none\">\n            <canvas id=\"data-canvas\" class=\"w-full h-full\"></canvas>\n\n            <!-- Central Document Graphic -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-64 h-80 bg-[#1a1a1a] rounded-xl shadow-2xl z-10 border border-white/5 flex flex-col p-8\">\n                <div class=\"w-16 h-3 bg-neutral-600/50 rounded-sm mb-3\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-24 h-3 bg-neutral-600/50 rounded-sm\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-5 right-5 w-5 h-5 bg-neutral-600/30 rounded-sm\"></div>\n                <div class=\"mt-auto w-1 h-20 bg-neutral-700/50 rounded-full\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Floating Data Blocks (Positioned via inline styles to sync with canvas lines) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute z-20 w-16 h-16 bg-yellow-400 rounded-sm shadow-lg flex items-end p-1 transform -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"left: calc(50% + 180px); top: calc(50% - 60px);\">\n                <span class=\"bg-white text-black text-xs font-mono px-1 leading-none uppercase\">pdf</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute z-20 w-12 h-12 bg-green-400 rounded-sm shadow-lg flex items-end p-1 transform -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"left: calc(50% + 240px); top: calc(50% + 15px);\">\n                <span class=\"bg-white text-black text-xs font-mono px-1 leading-none uppercase\">csv</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute z-20 w-14 h-14 bg-purple-400 rounded-sm shadow-lg flex items-end p-1 transform -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"left: calc(50% + 160px); top: calc(50% + 80px);\">\n                <span class=\"bg-white text-black text-xs font-mono px-1 leading-none uppercase\">json</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <div class=\"px-8 md:px-16 z-20 relative max-w-4xl\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight leading-[1.1] text-white\">\n                Unlock structured data<br />from any source\n            </h1>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Canvas Animation Script -->\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('data-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d', { alpha: true });\n        let width, height;\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n        }\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n        resize();\n\n        // Data stream configuration\n        const colors = ['#fde047', '#3b82f6', '#10b981', '#a855f7', '#ef4444', '#f97316', '#06b6d4'];\n        const numLines = 45;\n        const lines = Array.from({ length: numLines }, () => createLine(true));\n\n        function createLine(randomX = false) {\n            return {\n                x: randomX ? Math.random() * -width : -200,\n                length: Math.random() * 120 + 40,\n                speed: Math.random() * 4 + 2,\n                color: colors[Math.floor(Math.random() * colors.length)],\n                thickness: Math.random() > 0.7 ? 6 : 3,\n                offsetY: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 140 // Spread vertically relative to center\n            };\n        }\n\n        function draw() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            const centerY = height / 2;\n            const centerX = width / 2;\n            const docLeft = centerX - 128; // Half of w-64 (256px)\n            const docRight = centerX + 128;\n\n            // 1. Draw Output Grid (Right Side)\n            ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04)';\n            const gridSpacing = 14;\n            const gridStartX = docRight + 40;\n\n            for (let x = gridStartX; x < width; x += gridSpacing) {\n                for (let y = centerY - 100; y < centerY + 100; y += gridSpacing) {\n                    // Fade out grid towards the right edge\n                    const opacity = Math.max(0, 1 - ((x - gridStartX) / (width - gridStartX)));\n                    if (opacity > 0) {\n                        ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${opacity * 0.06})`;\n                        ctx.fillRect(x, y, 6, 6);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            // 2. Draw Connecting Lines (Document to Blocks)\n            ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15)';\n            ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n            ctx.beginPath();\n\n            // Line to Yellow Block\n            ctx.moveTo(docRight, centerY - 60);\n            ctx.lineTo(centerX + 180, centerY - 60);\n\n            // Line to Green Block\n            ctx.moveTo(docRight, centerY + 15);\n            ctx.lineTo(centerX + 240, centerY + 15);\n\n            // Line to Purple Block\n            ctx.moveTo(docRight, centerY + 80);\n            ctx.lineTo(centerX + 160, centerY + 80);\n\n            ctx.stroke();\n\n            // 3. Draw Incoming Data Streams (Left Side)\n            ctx.lineCap = 'butt';\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < lines.length; i++) {\n                const line = lines[i];\n                const yPos = centerY + line.offsetY;\n\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(line.x, yPos);\n\n                // Calculate end point, ensuring it doesn't cross into the document\n                const endX = Math.min(line.x + line.length, docLeft);\n\n                if (line.x < docLeft) {\n                    ctx.lineTo(endX, yPos);\n                    ctx.strokeStyle = line.color;\n                    ctx.lineWidth = line.thickness;\n                    ctx.stroke();\n                }\n\n                // Move line\n                line.x += line.speed;\n\n                // Reset line when it hits the document\n                if (line.x > docLeft) {\n                    lines[i] = createLine();\n                }\n            }\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n        }\n\n        // Start animation loop\n        draw();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-data-extraction.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-data-extraction.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-data-extraction-DESIGN.md", "views": 74, "forks": 5, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T17:31:11.666212+00:00"}